{
 "end": 239.25,
 "cues": [
  {
   "id": "c0.1",
   "section": "C0",
   "text": "AI isn't just evolving anymore.",
   "start": 8.15,
   "end": 10.47
  },
  {
   "id": "c0.2",
   "section": "C0",
   "text": "It's accelerating.",
   "start": 10.95,
   "end": 12.15
  },
  {
   "id": "c0.3",
   "section": "C0",
   "text": "Every single week, there's a new model.",
   "start": 12.87,
   "end": 15.19
  },
  {
   "id": "c0.4",
   "section": "C0",
   "text": "A new capability.",
   "start": 15.59,
   "end": 16.63
  },
  {
   "id": "c0.5",
   "section": "C0",
   "text": "A new breakthrough.",
   "start": 17.03,
   "end": 18.15
  },
  {
   "id": "c0.6",
   "section": "C0",
   "text": "But let's be honest…",
   "start": 18.85,
   "end": 19.89
  },
  {
   "id": "c0.7",
   "section": "C0",
   "text": "can anyone actually keep up?",
   "start": 20.37,
   "end": 22.37
  },
  {
   "id": "c1.1",
   "section": "C1",
   "text": "To create something truly beautiful, you're suddenly expected to understand",
   "start": 23.75,
   "end": 28.39
  },
  {
   "id": "c1.2",
   "section": "C1",
   "text": "prompt engineering,",
   "start": 28.55,
   "end": 29.59
  },
  {
   "id": "c1.3",
   "section": "C1",
   "text": "filmmaking,",
   "start": 29.91,
   "end": 30.63
  },
  {
   "id": "c1.4",
   "section": "C1",
   "text": "design,",
   "start": 31.03,
   "end": 31.35
  },
  {
   "id": "c1.5",
   "section": "C1",
   "text": "editing,",
   "start": 31.83,
   "end": 32.07
  },
  {
   "id": "c1.6",
   "section": "C1",
   "text": "and complex production pipelines.",
   "start": 32.47,
   "end": 34.31
  },
  {
   "id": "c1.7",
   "section": "C1",
   "text": "All at once.",
   "start": 34.79,
   "end": 35.75
  },
  {
   "id": "c1.8",
   "section": "C1",
   "text": "You spend more time learning the tools than actually creating with them.",
   "start": 36.65,
   "end": 40.25
  },
  {
   "id": "c1.9",
   "section": "C1",
   "text": "Every time a new model arrives:",
   "start": 41.05,
   "end": 42.73
  },
  {
   "id": "c1.10",
   "section": "C1",
   "text": "another workflow.",
   "start": 43.25,
   "end": 44.17
  },
  {
   "id": "c1.11",
   "section": "C1",
   "text": "Another interface.",
   "start": 44.57,
   "end": 45.69
  },
  {
   "id": "c1.12",
   "section": "C1",
   "text": "Another learning curve.",
   "start": 46.09,
   "end": 47.37
  },
  {
   "id": "c1.13",
   "section": "C1",
   "text": "It shouldn't be this hard.",
   "start": 48.77,
   "end": 50.21
  },
  {
   "id": "c2.1",
   "section": "C2",
   "text": "What if you didn't need to know which model is winning today?",
   "start": 51.25,
   "end": 54.37
  },
  {
   "id": "c2.2",
   "section": "C2",
   "text": "What if you could just…",
   "start": 55.01,
   "end": 56.21
  },
  {
   "id": "c2.3",
   "section": "C2",
   "text": "talk?",
   "start": 56.85,
   "end": 57.09
  },
  {
   "id": "c2.4",
   "section": "C2",
   "text": "Tell your agent what you want to create.",
   "start": 57.79,
   "end": 59.95
  },
  {
   "id": "c2.5",
   "section": "C2",
   "text": "Bring an idea.",
   "start": 60.45,
   "end": 61.25
  },
  {
   "id": "c2.6",
   "section": "C2",
   "text": "Bring a product.",
   "start": 61.73,
   "end": 62.61
  },
  {
   "id": "c2.7",
   "section": "C2",
   "text": "Bring a photograph.",
   "start": 62.93,
   "end": 63.97
  },
  {
   "id": "c2.8",
   "section": "C2",
   "text": "Or simply discover something that inspires you.",
   "start": 64.53,
   "end": 67.41
  },
  {
   "id": "c2.9",
   "section": "C2",
   "text": "Behind the scenes, your agent understands your intent,",
   "start": 68.01,
   "end": 71.13
  },
  {
   "id": "c2.10",
   "section": "C2",
   "text": "picks the right tools,",
   "start": 71.53,
   "end": 72.65
  },
  {
   "id": "c2.11",
   "section": "C2",
   "text": "and shows you the plan before anything is made.",
   "start": 73.09,
   "end": 75.61
  },
  {
   "id": "c2.12",
   "section": "C2",
   "text": "You approve.",
   "start": 76.21,
   "end": 76.93
  },
  {
   "id": "c2.13",
   "section": "C2",
   "text": "Your agent handles the rest.",
   "start": 77.33,
   "end": 78.77
  },
  {
   "id": "c2.14",
   "section": "C2",
   "text": "No model hunting.",
   "start": 79.47,
   "end": 80.51
  },
  {
   "id": "c2.15",
   "section": "C2",
   "text": "No complicated pipelines.",
   "start": 80.83,
   "end": 82.43
  },
  {
   "id": "c2.16",
   "section": "C2",
   "text": "No prompt engineering required.",
   "start": 82.75,
   "end": 84.51
  },
  {
   "id": "c2.17",
   "section": "C2",
   "text": "Just your imagination.",
   "start": 85.21,
   "end": 86.41
  },
  {
   "id": "c2.18",
   "section": "C2",
   "text": "And a conversation.",
   "start": 87.05,
   "end": 88.25
  },
  {
   "id": "c3.1",
   "section": "C3",
   "text": "From inspiration to creation.",
   "start": 92.5,
   "end": 94.58
  },
  {
   "id": "c3.2",
   "section": "C3",
   "text": "Discover something you love.",
   "start": 97.5,
   "end": 99.1
  },
  {
   "id": "c3.3",
   "section": "C3",
   "text": "Make it your own.",
   "start": 107.5,
   "end": 108.38
  },
  {
   "id": "c4.1",
   "section": "C4",
   "text": "Because behind every card is a living template.",
   "start": 116.25,
   "end": 119.53
  },
  {
   "id": "c4.2",
   "section": "C4",
   "text": "Not a rigid preset, but a creative intent.",
   "start": 120.33,
   "end": 123.61
  },
  {
   "id": "c4.3",
   "section": "C4",
   "text": "Your agent understands the original vision.",
   "start": 125.41,
   "end": 127.97
  },
  {
   "id": "c4.4",
   "section": "C4",
   "text": "The movement.",
   "start": 128.57,
   "end": 129.41
  },
  {
   "id": "c4.5",
   "section": "C4",
   "text": "The rhythm.",
   "start": 129.69,
   "end": 130.37
  },
  {
   "id": "c4.6",
   "section": "C4",
   "text": "The atmosphere.",
   "start": 130.73,
   "end": 131.73
  },
  {
   "id": "c4.7",
   "section": "C4",
   "text": "The visual language.",
   "start": 132.17,
   "end": 133.49
  },
  {
   "id": "c4.8",
   "section": "C4",
   "text": "Then reimagines that creative world around your photo.",
   "start": 134.29,
   "end": 137.89
  },
  {
   "id": "c4.9",
   "section": "C4",
   "text": "Your product.",
   "start": 138.45,
   "end": 139.33
  },
  {
   "id": "c4.10",
   "section": "C4",
   "text": "Your story.",
   "start": 139.77,
   "end": 140.53
  },
  {
   "id": "c5.1",
   "section": "C5",
   "text": "And here's the beautiful part.",
   "start": 143.75,
   "end": 145.43
  },
  {
   "id": "c5.2",
   "section": "C5",
   "text": "You don't need to know the language of filmmaking.",
   "start": 146.07,
   "end": 148.47
  },
  {
   "id": "c5.3",
   "section": "C5",
   "text": "Push in.",
   "start": 149.17,
   "end": 149.73
  },
  {
   "id": "c5.4",
   "section": "C5",
   "text": "Dolly out.",
   "start": 150.21,
   "end": 150.93
  },
  {
   "id": "c5.5",
   "section": "C5",
   "text": "Fisheye.",
   "start": 151.33,
   "end": 151.89
  },
  {
   "id": "c5.6",
   "section": "C5",
   "text": "Bird's-eye.",
   "start": 152.24,
   "end": 152.88
  },
  {
   "id": "c5.7",
   "section": "C5",
   "text": "Lens choices.",
   "start": 153.28,
   "end": 154.24
  },
  {
   "id": "c5.8",
   "section": "C5",
   "text": "Lighting.",
   "start": 154.48,
   "end": 155.04
  },
  {
   "id": "c5.9",
   "section": "C5",
   "text": "None of that is your job.",
   "start": 155.84,
   "end": 157.28
  },
  {
   "id": "c5.10",
   "section": "C5",
   "text": "You bring the product.",
   "start": 158.28,
   "end": 159.4
  },
  {
   "id": "c5.11",
   "section": "C5",
   "text": "Your agent directs the shot.",
   "start": 159.88,
   "end": 161.4
  },
  {
   "id": "c6.1",
   "section": "C6",
   "text": "A single photograph can become a cinematic experience.",
   "start": 166.25,
   "end": 169.93
  },
  {
   "id": "c6.4",
   "section": "C6",
   "text": "A screenshot can become something you're wearing.",
   "start": 171.63,
   "end": 174.11
  },
  {
   "id": "c6.4b",
   "section": "C6",
   "text": "Every piece you photograph settles into your wardrobe.",
   "start": 175.61,
   "end": 178.73
  },
  {
   "id": "c6.4c",
   "section": "C6",
   "text": "See it on you, before you buy.",
   "start": 181.33,
   "end": 183.49
  },
  {
   "id": "c6.2",
   "section": "C6",
   "text": "A fashion image can become a moving editorial.",
   "start": 187.19,
   "end": 190.15
  },
  {
   "id": "c6.3",
   "section": "C6",
   "text": "The ad you admire becomes yours.",
   "start": 192.05,
   "end": 194.45
  },
  {
   "id": "c6.3b",
   "section": "C6",
   "text": "In your language.",
   "start": 195.1,
   "end": 196.3
  },
  {
   "id": "c6.3c",
   "section": "C6",
   "text": "And brought to life.",
   "start": 196.95,
   "end": 198.23
  },
  {
   "id": "c6.5",
   "section": "C6",
   "text": "One idea.",
   "start": 211.5,
   "end": 212.3
  },
  {
   "id": "c6.6",
   "section": "C6",
   "text": "One conversation.",
   "start": 212.7,
   "end": 213.82
  },
  {
   "id": "c6.7",
   "section": "C6",
   "text": "Endless ways to create.",
   "start": 214.3,
   "end": 215.82
  },
  {
   "id": "c7.1",
   "section": "C7",
   "text": "The models will keep changing.",
   "start": 217.5,
   "end": 219.18
  },
  {
   "id": "c7.2",
   "section": "C7",
   "text": "Every single week.",
   "start": 219.66,
   "end": 221.02
  },
  {
   "id": "c7.3",
   "section": "C7",
   "text": "You don't have to.",
   "start": 222.12,
   "end": 223.0
  }
 ]
}